From: bullhead-linux <kaiwalyakhasnis57@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno: add the Adreno 418 (MSM8992)

The Nexus 5X GPU, chip id 4.1.8.0. The kernel (drm/msm, "drm/msm/a4xx: add
the Adreno 418") runs it like an A430 with 512 KiB of GMEM, which it reports
itself; userspace needs nothing but its id next to the other A4xx parts.
---
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -228,6 +228,7 @@
 
 add_gpus([
         GPUId(405),
+        GPUId(418),
         GPUId(420),
         GPUId(430),
     ], GPUInfo(
